    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049830/extras/d27474ca1a4dbe1214f54a4299ca1335.poster.avif?t=1754248043\" width=640 height=293 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049830/extras/d27474ca1a4dbe1214f54a4299ca1335.webm?t=1754248043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OUTTA HELL\u00a0</strong>puts you in the shoes of a former bank robber. Now imprisoned by the ruling corporations of the afterlife, you have to escape your newfound  purgatory. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore haunting and stunning dimensions of the afterlife. Fight hordes of hollow souls and military demons.  Tear down the corporations of hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrilling action combat \u2714</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full body movement \u2714</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow Mo - Bullet Time \u2714 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An arsenal of weapons and equipment \u2714</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark, ethereal aesthetic \u2714</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variation of environments throughout the story \u2714</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hub World\u00a0\u2714</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WORK IN PROGRESS - NOT REPRESENTATIVE OF FINAL QUALITY</strong>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049830/extras/23cfa3d6ab7eccaabbb7a812877bb45a.avif?t=1754248043\" width=370 height=125 /></span></p>